OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr backs hometown music
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV star Alan Carr has been "really
OL,7,Fsupportive" of a music festival held in
OL,8,Fhis hometown that is returning for its
OL,9,F19th year, according to the organiser.
OL,11,FNorthampton Music Festival will see 85
OL,12,Fartists perform at various locations
OL,13,Facross the town on Sunday.
OL,15,FCarr, who was born in the town, urged
OL,16,Fpeople in a video message posted on the
OL,17,Fevent's social media channels to attend
OL,18,Fthe town centre event - and joked "you
OL,19,Fmight even see me... outside the
OL,20,FGrosvenor Centre".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
