OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr backs hometown music
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvent organiser Tommy Gardner said Carr
OL,7,Fwas "always up" for helping support
OL,8,Finitiatives in Northampton.
